      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Happy Mother\u2019s Day, to Apoorva and to every mom out there! \u2764\ufe0f",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2053538005496041927",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-10T18:09:48+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Congrats to Ohio State men\u2019s tennis for another massive win over Illinois yesterday. Onwards to the NCAA quarterfinals next week! \ud83c\udfbe\n\n\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2053206176356262375",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T20:11:13+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "I believe in celebrating success, Amy Acton believes in villainizing it. Businesses will flee our state in droves if she comes anywhere near power &amp; it will be an economic devastation of a kind our state has never seen.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2053202391055638698",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T19:56:11+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Slash income &amp; property taxes. Bring standards back to public education. Produce more energy to bring down electric bills. We can do this.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2053193568215605413",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T19:21:07+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Ohio has no place for socialism, and Ohio\u2019s government has no place for Amy Acton. She failed Ohio once &amp; we won\u2019t let her fail us again.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2053175635342934298",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T18:09:52+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "My opponent stood in front of cameras with a white coat claiming the mantle of \u201cscience,\u201d while failing to follow the actual science. It was unforgivable. Ohio families are still suffering because of it &amp; they can\u2019t afford to ever trust Dr. Lockdown again.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2053156766930850186",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T16:54:53+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "The taxpayer is not a piggy bank to be bilked. We will comprehensively review Ohio\u2019s $40BN+ Medicaid expenditures and aggressively prosecute illegal abuses of the program. That starts in early 2027 &amp; we won\u2019t hold back.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2053147627932577793",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T16:18:34+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We won\u2019t apologize for enforcing the rule of law. I intend to thoroughly investigate &amp; aggressively prosecute waste, fraud, &amp; abuse in Medicaid and other government programs - and put that $$ back in the pockets of law-abiding Ohioans.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2053133403286110454",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T15:22:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s a shame that city leaders in my hometown of Cincinnati have declared it a \u201csanctuary city.\u201d That\u2019ll change when I\u2019m in charge of Ohio. We\u2019ll never condone violating the law, or else the people lose respect for the rule of law itself.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2053120440747626769",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-09T14:30:32+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "A reporter asked me what are three of my core values. Here\u2019s what I said.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052857862607843711",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T21:07:09+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "There\u2019s a reason why trade unions have overwhelmingly endorsed me over my Democrat opponent. They rightfully want lower costs &amp; bigger paychecks and understand that I\u2019ll be able to deliver that in a way that Amy Acton just can\u2019t.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052846237351850302",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T20:20:57+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "We will always respect &amp; back our veterans. \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052837145988231277",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T19:44:50+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Cut the waste, fraud, &amp; abuse in government handouts - and put that money back in the pockets of hardworking Ohioans.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052777738315104508",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-08T15:48:46+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is unacceptable &amp; will end when I\u2019m elected. We will prosecute the lawbreakers &amp; put the saved dollars back in the hands of Ohioans. It\u2019s shameful that socialist Amy Acton appears to condone this by ignoring it.\n\n\nLuke Rosiak (@lukerosiak)\n\nYou've heard about this story. Now you get to see it.\n\nI traveled to Columbus, Ohio, and witnessed the most egregious government waste I've seen in my 20 years as an investigative reporter.\n\nThis has been going on for years, and you've been payin",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052531230898614506",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T23:29:14+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "This is why we\u2019re doing it.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052475568998989955",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T19:48:03+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Such an energetic 85-year-old man. Respect him immensely.\n\nVideo",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/VivekGRamaswamy/status/2052434869322740162",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-07T17:06:19+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "vivek-ramaswamy",
      "voiceName": "Vivek Ramaswamy",
      "platform": "x",
